# Empty Memories (jeuno 70): the available check's operands one at a time, at Harith (no script; default 111). A level 75
# Warrior, CoP Below the Arks current (118, under The Mothercrystals' 128; a GM, before login) with its Option var 0: 111
# (no section). Option -1 (a GM; > 0 false, where != 0 would hold): 111. Option 1: 113 (option 0: nothing). Option 0
# again, Below the Arks completed and The Mothercrystals current (GMs; addMission refuses to overwrite a current
# mission): 113 (the edge). The Mothercrystals completed, The Lost City current (218, over it): 113, option 1: begun.
lists RuludeGardens/Harith/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/113
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=-4.3,2,132.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop BelowTheArks current
login
trigger Harith                          # Below the Arks, Option 0: no section; his default 111
finish
charvar Mission[6][118]Option -1        # a GM
trigger Harith                          # Option -1: 111
finish
charvar Mission[6][118]Option 1         # a GM
trigger Harith                          # Option 1: 113
finish option=0                         # nothing
charvar Mission[6][118]Option 0         # a GM
mission Cop BelowTheArks completed      # a GM
mission Cop TheMothercrystals current   # a GM
trigger Harith                          # The Mothercrystals: 113
finish option=0
mission Cop TheMothercrystals completed # a GM
mission Cop TheLostCity current         # a GM
trigger Harith                          # The Lost City (218): 113
finish option=1                         # begun
